@base = http://localhost:3000

### All loaded models (GAISe GaiseListModelsResponse shape)
GET {{base}}/v1/models

### Filters like GAISe
GET {{base}}/v1/models?operation=embeddings&provider=embeddinggemma

### One model, by any spelling
GET {{base}}/v1/models/embeddinggemma::embeddinggemma-2

### Health
GET {{base}}/health
